    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d606-a1">

                <pb facs="0652" n="602" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg602"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 111.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Valera to Mr. Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ministry of
                            State</hi>, <lb/>
                        <placeName type="venue"><hi rendition="#italic">Palace</hi></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1894-01-17"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January 17, 1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">excellency</hi>: In answer to your note dated the
                    15th instant, in which your excellency asks when the authorized version of the
                    repertory for the Island of Cuba will be published in said island, I have the
                    honor to inform you that I have communicated its contents to my colleague, the
                    minister of ultramar, and that as soon as I receive an answer I will hasten to
                    communicate it to you.</p>
                <p>I seize, etc.,</p>
                <p>By authorization:</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Joaquin Valera.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
